{'symbol': 'MDT', 'date': '2019-11-19 14:30:00', 'title': 'Medtronic To Get More Aggressive With Tuck-In M&A', 'text': 'MEDTRONIC PLC - REVENUE IN SECOND HALF OF 2020 TO GROW FASTER THAN THE FIRST, HELPED BY NEW PRODUCT LAUNCHES - CONF CALL.MEDTRONIC PLC - EXPECTS Q3 EPS OF $1.37 TO $1.39, INCLUDING $0.02 CURRENCY HEADWIND AT CURRENT RATES - CONF CALL.MEDTRONIC PLC - CARDIAC & VASCULAR GROUP TO GROW 2.5% TO 3% IN 2020, UP FROM PRIOR FORECAST OF 2.5% GROWTH - CONF CALL.MEDTRONIC PLC - MINIMALLY INVASIVE THERAPIES GROUP TO GROW 5% TO 5.5% IN 2020, UP FROM PRIOR FORECAST OF 5% GROWTH - CONF CALL.MEDTRONIC PLC - RESTORATIVE THERAPIES GROUP TO GROW 4.5% TO 5% IN 2020, UP FROM PRIOR FORECAST OF 4% TO 4.5% GROWTH - CONF CALL.MEDTRONIC - IF RECENT EXCHANGE RATES HOLD, FOREIGN CURRENCY TO HAVE A NEGATIVE IMPACT ON 2020 REVENUE GROWTH OF ABOUT  80 TO 120 BASIS POINTS - CONF CALL.MEDTRONIC - WILL FOCUS ON GETTING MORE AGGRESSIVE WITH TUCK-IN M&A AND CAPITAL ALLOCATION TO THE HIGHEST GROWTH SEGMENTS – INCOMING CEO ON CONF CALL.MEDTRONIC - EXPECT LOW SINGLE-DIGIT ORGANIC GROWTH FOR DIABETES GROUP IN 2020, REFLECTING COMPETITIVE PRESSURES IN THE U.S. - CONF CALL.'}
{'symbol': 'MDT', 'date': '2019-11-19 09:30:00', 'title': 'Medtronic Reports Q2 Earnings Per Share Of $1.31', 'text': 'MEDTRONIC REPORTS SECOND QUARTER FINANCIAL RESULTS.Q2 NON-GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE $1.31.Q2 GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE $1.01.Q2 EARNINGS PER SHARE ESTIMATE $1.28 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.RAISES FY20 EPS GUIDANCE.QTRLY REVENUE OF $7.7 BILLION INCREASED 3.0% REPORTED AND 4.1% ORGANIC.RTG Q2 REVENUE OF $2.112 BILLION INCREASED 6.0 PERCENT AS REPORTED.CVG Q2 REVENUE OF $2.855 BILLION DECREASED 0.1 PERCENT AS REPORTED.BRAIN THERAPIES Q2 REVENUE OF $772 MILLION INCREASED 10.1 PERCENT AS REPORTED.MITG Q2 REVENUE OF $2.142 BILLION INCREASED 4.6 PERCENT AS REPORTED.SPINE Q2 REVENUE OF $692 MILLION INCREASED 5.5 PERCENT AS REPORTED.COMPANY CONTINUES TO EXPECT REVENUE GROWTH IN ITS FISCAL YEAR 2020 TO APPROXIMATE 4.0% ON AN ORGANIC BASIS.INCREASED FISCAL YEAR 2020 DILUTED NON-GAAP EPS GUIDANCE TO NEW RANGE OF $5.57 TO $5.63.IF CURRENT EXCHANGE RATES HOLD, REVENUE GROWTH IN FY 2020 WOULD BE NEGATIVELY AFFECTED BY 0.8% TO 1.2%.FY 2020 NON-GAAP EPS GUIDANCE INCLUDES AN ESTIMATED 9 CENT NEGATIVE IMPACT FROM FOREIGN EXCHANGE BASED ON CURRENT RATES.Q2 REVENUE VIEW $7.66 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.FY2020 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $5.56, REVENUE VIEW $31.48 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.'}
{'symbol': 'MDT', 'date': '2019-11-19 22:30:00', 'title': 'Medtronic plc Reiterates Revenue Growth Guidance for Fiscal 2020', 'text': 'Medtronic plc reiterated its revenue growth guidance for fiscal 2020. The company continues to expect revenue growth in its fiscal year 2020 to approximate 4.0% on an organic basis and for revenue growth to accelerate in the second half relative to the first. If current exchange rates hold, revenue growth in fiscal year 2020 would be negatively affected by 0.8 to 1.2%.'}
